  "notes": "USAGE: {応接|おうせつ} is commonly used in business and formal contexts.\n\nCOMMON COMPOUNDS:\n・{応接|おうせつ}{室|しつ} (reception room, parlor)\n・{応接|おうせつ}セット (reception room furniture - sofa and chairs)\n・{応接|おうせつ}{間|ま} (reception room - in homes)\n・{応接|おうせつ}{係|がかり} (receptionist)\n\nPATTERNS:\n・{応接|おうせつ}する (to receive guests)\n・{応接|おうせつ}に{暇|いとま}がない (to be too busy with visitors to do anything else)\n\nRELATED:\n・{接客|せっきゃく} - customer service, serving customers\n・{応対|おうたい} - reception, dealing with people",
